# textures.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# fl-engine shows a pixel-buffer texture through a Texture widget; the
# golden draws the same 64x64 pattern as an image in its place, with the
# same FilterQuality: nearest, scaled up four times, and linear, stretched,
# turned, faded to 0.8 and clipped to a rounded rectangle. What differs is
# the linear copy's cell edges and the clip's, a level or a few, and the
# faded colors by a level. Measured 2026-11-23: lavapipe 8.066% differ,
# 0.011% by more than 32; radv 1.121%, 0.011%.
differ 10
differ_over_32 0.1
